let __v_182 = Value::from("Copy things off it before you delete anything: a card that fills up in a camera is often a confused file table, and bulk deleting on the camera loses shots. Plug the card into a laptop with a reader, drag the photos and videos to the computer or to Google Photos, then let the camera format the card from its own menu - not the computer. A bigger card is cheap: 64GB is about a tenner, and take one labelled U3 or V30 if it is for video.");
